	(text "FujiNet for the Sega Master System / SMS2 - Rev0 (RP2354B).  Signal flow left to right: the console's\ncartridge slot -> the RP2354B on the 5V cart bus (+ 1 MB SRAM and its 74HCT glue) -> ESP32-S3 (FujiNet, WiFi,\nmicroSD) -> USB-C / CP2102N.  Power (rails only): console 5V via a P-FET and USB VBUS via an SS34 meet on +5V;\n+3V3 buck (S3, SD, bridge); +3V3_RP LDO (every RP2354B supply pin, rises with the console's 5V).\nRP pin map: fujinet-firmware pico/sms sms_cart.h; S3 pin map: fujiversal-sms.h; glue: sms_glue_oe / _we\n(tools/check_nets.py and tools/check_glue.py hold the netlist to them)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 190.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.524 1.524)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "961e13e9-b4c3-5063-8b00-7ba3a4f57a97")
	)
